			description: [
				"Wireless transceiver: divided into master and slave. There is only one master and no limit on the slave. The machine ownership is determined by the frequency number."
				""
				"Channel card: The channel card requires an unlimited transceiver as a front. Shift left button to claim the channel card. Right button can adjust the frequency. The frequency should be the same as the transceiver frequency."
