		{
			dependencies: ["6FB14354662467B7"]
			description: [
				"Fill the infinite generator with generator fragments. The grid interface is used to export power. The power is sent directly to your grid."
				""
				"Wireless energy monitor can check unlimited grid power status"
				""
				"The adaptive distribution grid needs to be bound to the grid terminal. Energy, laser energy, and power bins need to be placed in the terminal. The higher the level of the bin, the higher the level of the adaptive distribution grid."
				""
				"The wireless network output and input terminal allows the use of all energy in the grid. The default is the highest max level, so it cannot be used in general factories (small machines do not have max)."
				"One fragment generates electricity 10 times 100 fragments = E102eu"
