			dependencies: ["6FB14354662467B7"]
			description: [
				"The MAX synthetic memory is part of the CPU (actually the main body) and provides Long.MAX_VALUE synthetic storage. The 1024x parallel unit is complementary to each other. &l&cDo not put two MAX synthetic memories unless you want the Long type to directly overflow into a negative number."
				""
				"The me task detector is used to detect items in the AE network to complete tasks. You no longer need to take out items and put them in the inventory to complete the task. It will also detect fluids. When submitting items, items in AE will also be submitted."
				""
				"The Swallowing Wanlai disk is an unlimited storage disk with no type restrictions and no storage restrictions. Bigint type. However: the Java C2 ​​compiler has a bug in compiling the BigInteger type."
				""
				"Wireless Connector You need a master. The remaining slaves will inherit the master's channel."
				""
				"The ME Ender Transmitter has a G key to think about. In short, it is: within the range (configuration file) of the wireless supply channel"
