		{
			dependencies: ["0CFCBADA589A5458"]
			description: [
				"&l&eincludes but is not limited to performance optimization mixins for: AE2, EAEP, FTBQ, GTCEu, KubeJS, GTLCore, etc."
				""
				"&e&linstance (AE2): &aAE2 StorageService optimization, AE2 calls storage.getAvailableStacks() every tick, and the performance takes up 9.97%"
				"- &7**Incremental update** (main thread): listen to NetworkStorage.insert/extract, record delta"
				"- &7**Asynchronous scan** (background thread): full scan every 100 ticks, non-blocking reading of results by the main thread"
				"- &7**Mixed strategy**: Normal tick is incremental, forced update is synchronous full scan"
				"&a&lEffect: 9.97% → completely disappeared (from spark performance high-occupancy items)"
			]
