		{
			description: [
				"God Forge has 15 times the output of the full formula &cNote: The pseudo-god has the \"conservation law of jars\". When the output is 15 times, you need to input additional empty jars corresponding to the magnification. It is only recommended that you burn it for 4 hours first, or the terminal hub is permanently locked and takes a long time."
				""
				"For example: Containing strange matter formula input [1x lepton bomb, 1x containing high-density proton matter, 9x a small amount of degenerate rhenium powder, 14x time dilation sealed unit] The time dilation sealed unit is the so-called empty can"
				""
				"This is a machine-type restricted behavior and does not belong to the formula behavior. jei will not display how much you should need. &cgtceu will not transmit machine-type requirements to jei [Hongmeng needs hydrogen and helium for the same reason. jei will not display it. If you are stupid enough to find out why jei can't be used, you are a fool]"
				""
				"&l&aModule independent mark: Allows the independent option of this host module to be turned on in the configuration file. After the configuration is turned on, the module can run independently."
			]
			id: "00F638690A0B188D"
			quest_enhance_disable_scroll_paging: false
			subtitle: "Added new recipe for it"
